      "descriptionHtml": "<p>Introducing the Torio, a captivating 3D-printed plant holder with a unique geometric design. This elegant piece features a lattice structure that not only enhances its aesthetic appeal but also provides excellent ventilation for your plants. Perfect for small indoor plants, the Torio adds a touch of modern sophistication to any space. Crafted with eco-friendly materials, this planter is both stylish and sustainable, making it an ideal addition to your home decor. Whether placed on a shelf, desk, or windowsill, the Torio is sure to become a centerpiece of your indoor garden.</p>\n<p>Key Features:</p>\n<p>3D-Printed Excellence: Expertly crafted with a unique ribbed texture for a contemporary look.</p>\n<p>Versatile Sizing: Choose from 2\" (displayed), 3\", or 4\" openings to suit your plant needs.<br>\nColor Options: Available in a range of colors to complement any decor.</p>\n<p>Functional Design: Features drainage holes for optimal plant health.</p>\n<p>Included Stand: Comes with a matching stand for added stability and style.</p>\n<p>Redefine your plant display with The Torio. Whether you're a plant novice or a seasoned enthusiast, this planter is the perfect blend of function and design.</p>",
